<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia buys 13,000 T soy pellets-traders.</title>
<headline>Tunisia buys 13,000 T soy pellets-traders.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-09-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia bought 13,000 tonnes of Argentina's soy pellets at $297.97 C&amp;F per tonne at a tender on Friday, traders said. Shipment is for October 25-November 5.</p>
<p>-- Tunis newsroom, -2161-787538</p>
</text>
